 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Fortune Cookie" href="/whats-on/the-fortune-cookie" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Fortune Cookie</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Lemmon and Matthau shine in Billy Wilder’s tale of a high-profile accident serving up a golden ticket to riches and sympathy for a reluctant cameraman.</p>
  </div>
