 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <p class="show-type" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Families</p>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Frankenweenie" href="/whats-on/frankenweenie" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Frankenweenie</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Tim Burton’s heartfelt, oddball story is a moving tribute to horror films of the 1930s.</p>
