 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Ganja and Hess" href="/whats-on/ganja-and-hess" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Ganja and Hess</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Wrongfully marketed as a Blaxploitation film on release, Bill Gunn’s atmospheric Black vampire story is a rumination on the tensions between religion and desire.</p>
  </div>
