   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Hell on Earth: The Desecration and Resurrection of The Devils" href="/whats-on/hell-on-earth-the-desecration-and-resurrection-of-the-devils" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Hell on Earth: The Desecration and Resurrection of The Devils</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Mark Kermode presents this fascinating, detailed account of the history and making of Ken Russell’s masterpiece, and the outrage that followed in the wake of its release.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>2002</span>
  </div>
 </div>
