 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="House of Usher (aka The Fall of the House of Usher)" href="/whats-on/house-of-usher-aka-the-fall-of-the-house-of-usher" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>House of Usher (aka The Fall of the House of Usher)</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The first of Corman’s terrific cycle inspired by the works of Edgar Allan Poe set the standard for what was to come.</p>
  </div>
