 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Irma la Douce" href="/whats-on/irma-la-douce" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Irma la Douce</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Wilder, Lemmon and MacLaine reunite in this comedy built on infatuation, insecurity, satire and just a sprinkling of sugar.</p>
