 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <p class="show-type" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Talk</p>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Julie Corman in Conversation" href="/whats-on/julie-corman-in-conversation" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Julie Corman in Conversation</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The producer and wife of one of American cinema’s most resourceful and influential writer-director-producers discusses Roger Corman’s impact on cinema over the course of the last 60 years.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
