 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Ken Russell’s The Devils" href="/whats-on/the-devils" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Ken Russell’s The Devils</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screenings available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Censored for over half a century, Ken Russell’s film returns in a landmark director’s cut reconstruction that reveals the full power of his original vision.</p>
  </div>
