 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Kiss Me, Stupid" href="/whats-on/kiss-me-stupid" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Kiss Me, Stupid</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>An aspiring songwriter constructs a deranged ruse to hide his wife from Dean Martin’s successful lounge singer, while remaining desperate for his attention.</p>
  </div>
