 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <p class="show-type" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Seniors</p>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Mandabi" href="/whats-on/mandabi" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Mandabi</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>This was the first feature-length African language film to be produced out of West Africa, courtesy of Senegalese maestro Ousmane Sembène.</p>
  </div>
